** What is Java? **
	-> Java is a object oriented language , developed by james gosling under sun microsystems in 1995. Its first version was released in 1996 - JDK 1.0.
	-> Later the Java was taken over by Oracle.

** Features of Java **
	-> Simple and Easy to Understand
	-> Object Oriented - Java is not Fully OOP Language, because it supports the premitive datatype
	-> Secured         - Since java does not support pointer concept, has encapsulation, abstraction etc.
	-> Scalable
	-> Multi-threading 
	-> Platform Independent - Why?? 
	-> Portable
	-> Robust
	
