** JDK vs JRE vs JVM **
	-> JDK- Java Development Kit which includes all the libraries, and development tools
	-> JRE- Java Real-time Environment , it loads the classes for execution
	-> JVM- Java Virtual MAchine , Performs main execution of java code, it helps in garbage collection, etc. like taks
	
